# Personal financial / broker data
# Repository is PRIVATE -- broker CSV/XLSX files under data/imports/ are
# intentionally committed so GitHub Actions can access them directly.
# Root-level data files (generated / temporary) remain excluded.
data/*.csv
data/*.xlsx

# Credentials / secrets -- NEVER commit regardless of repo visibility
.env
*.env
credentials.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*.pem
*.key

